{"parentUuid":"2b08562e-fe23-4d6d-a20d-d9ee25a3f96d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf13ooPfej1KmqfVAu3Dg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CONTRADICTION: ~/reference_secondbrain-backup.md vs DEV/project_secondbrain-vault-location.md - backup file puts the vault at `~/Desktop/SecondBrain`; the location file says it moved to `~/SecondBrain` on 2026-08-14 and that the old path no longer exists.\nCONTRADICTION: ~/reference_secondbrain-backup.md vs DEV/project_backup-sync-system.md - backup file says there is no scheduler/cron and the vault is backed up by hand via `./backup.sh`; the nightly launchd `daily-backup.ps1` commits and pushes SecondBrain through its hardcoded `Sync-Repo` list.\nCONTRADICTION: ~/reference_secondbrain-backup.md vs DEV/project_status-report-sourcing.md - the cadence doc described here carries 9 KRs, which status-report-sourcing says is the superseded v2 set and will produce wrong facts against the v3 doc's 14 KRs.\nCONTRADICTION: ~/reference_okr-staff-meeting-prep.md vs DEV/project_status-report-sourcing.md - the KR deep-dive artifact states Eric's lean on \"all 9 KRs\"; the v3 OKR doc that is the required source has 14.\nCONTRADICTION: ~/reference_secondbrain-backup.md vs global-memory/MEMORY.md - says \"Eric DRI on all 9 KRs; AJ/Blake co-own\"; MEMORY.md records Blake has LEFT and AJ owns FB.\nCONTRADICTION: DEV/project_vendored-skill-install.md vs DEV/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md - vendored-skill-install makes `~/.agents/skills/` the canonical store with `~/.claude/skills/` symlinked into it; the 2026-09-12 architecture decision inverts this, making `~/.claude/skills/` canonical and `~/.agents/`/`~/.codex/` generated views.\nCONTRADICTION: ~/feedback_daily-brief-and-execution-partner.md vs DEV/user_working-conditions-bottleneck.md - one says when he idea-dumps, distill immediately into an ordered actionable list and drive execution; the other says do not rush to