s the CLI was printed in Aug 2026 and a Zotero MCP server plus `pp-zotero-research-library` skill are live.\nSTALE: ~/project_catapult_cli.md - names a Windows `catapult-pp-cli.exe` binary under `~/printing-press/library/catapult` and mislabels the `.env` token file as the historical DB; the file itself notes it is superseded by the `pp-catapult-openfield-connect` skill.\nSTALE: ~/reference_okr-staff-meeting-prep.md - locates all four artifacts under `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\OneDrive - Baylor University\\...`, a Windows path superseded by the macOS migration.\nSTALE: DEV/project_command-centre.md - the `/os` view section says it renders 148 skills; the 2026-09-12 audit cut the global roster to 61.\nSTALE: DEV/project_ath-tech-framework.md - lists \"the separate inventory email to staff\" as an open action; DEV/project_tech-inventory-refresh.md records the reminder was sent 2026-09-08 with a 29 September deadline.\nSTALE: DEV/project_backup-sync-system.md - the traps section states \"Tier A memory is NOT in git\"; the 2026-09-09 section in the same file says commit `8a3d55c` un-ignored `projects/` and explicitly invalidates that trap.\nSTALE: DEV/project_backup-sync-system.md - the 2026-09-04 completeness signal (9 jobs without SSD, 31 with) is superseded later in the same file by the 2026-09-09 baseline of 76 jobs.\nSTALE: ~/project_practice-load-framework.md - says the next deliverable is the day-by-day color templates and suggests a status check-in before the Aug 5 fall-camp start; that date has passed and DEV/project_dormant-threads.md records the work as parked.\nREDUNDANT: ~/project_practice-load-framework.md vs ~/project_facecomps-practice-simulator.md - the color-day system, rep ramp, mock-game rules and owners are described in both; facecomps (through 2026-06-16) is newer and holds the full decision log.\nREDUNDANT: DEV/project_path-shadowing-and-cleanup.md vs DEV/project_fireflies-cli-broken-on-mac.md - both carry the open \"rotate the Fireflies API key\" action; the fireflies file's entry is newer (moved there 2026-09-09) and names the Keychain as the store.\nREDUNDANT: ~/project_catapult_cli.md vs DEV/project_printing-press-spec-traps.md - the v6 stats-endpoint, date-format and filter traps appear in both; printing-press-spec-traps is newer and adds the date-filter hang."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":139536,"cache_read_input_tokens":129614,"output_tokens":11402,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8829},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":129614,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":8856,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":129614,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":129614},"type":"message"},{"input_tokens":139731,"output_tokens":11821,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"advisor_message","model":"claude-fable-5"},{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2546,"cache_read_input_tokens":129614,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9922,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9922,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"requestId":"req_011Cf13onem2WL5JqtmWX4RY","type":"assistant","uuid":"aab63851-ff03-4549-8856-3ec1b3ed0dbf","timestamp":"2026-09-13T07:37:10.441Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-py","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/global-memory","sessionId":"c922703c-e012-455a-8f07-d26099b07dc4","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"main"}
